# Paths that stay in the GitHub repo but are NOT published to the gd-img-cdn
# Pages site. One repo-relative directory (or file) per line; blank lines and
# '#' comments ignored.
#
# Applied by cdn_exclude.sh, which runs as the Pages build command. Pages builds
# from a fresh clone, so deleting from that clone withholds a file from the CDN
# without touching GitHub. Excluded files also stop counting toward the Pages
# 20,000-file limit.
#
# A listed path that does NOT exist fails the build on purpose: a typo here
# would silently publish something meant to be withheld.

# PoiCL v1.2 images, superseded by PoiCL_V123/. Nothing on the CDN points here --
# only the retired jsDelivr-era PoiCL_1_本体_v1 map does.
PoiCL_Image

# 補強土 Ver15 本体, retired in favour of Ver16 (user 2026-09-02).
# Deliberate breakage: 補強土_15_本体_v2_map.json (+ its image_map.json) still
# carries 666 urls under this path, and they 404 once this exclusion is live.
補強土/補強土15_Image
